nging to a better model."}],"summary":"The sole disputed amendment (fr-2-ba1e4ade) proposes replacing the single-porosity Bouldin penetration model with a layer-by-layer iterative approach. After examining the code, this is REJECTED. The implementation correctly applies the Bouldin (1968) homogeneous-medium model using surface-layer porosity as a deliberate first-order approximation. This is confirmed by documentation, test coverage (surface_cap_bottleneck_test), and the model's mathematical formulation. The proposed change is a model fidelity enhancement, not a bug fix. The planner and first reviewer's rejection is well-founded; the second reviewer's acceptance conflates model simplification with implementation error."},"fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"720f8ec8-e8a8-419e-b2c4-153db69ad954"}
